- ~/ is not processed in pathnames. It should be taken as an
  abbreviation for (user-homedir-pathname).

  (pathname "~/foo/bar") == (merge-pathnames "foo/bar" (user-homedir-pathname))


    20:07[pjb@thalassa org.xquartz:0 bocl 35Gi]$ sources/bocl

